res confirmed settlement)\\\\n\\\\nRequired actions (per RevRec policy):\\\\n1) Do NOT update CRM opportunity to Closed Won.\\\\n2) Notify customer AP immediately to resubmit payment to avoid service interruption.\\\\n   Approved wording: “Your payment of $47,500 was not received / payment failed — please resubmit payment immediately.”\\\\n\\\\nIf you already sent a “thank you/payment received” email, send a correction ASAP and flag to RevAcct.\\\\n\",\"ts\":1792007582.446813,\"thread_ts\":null}]'}",
